77	1298,1160,1617,1721	Fig. 77.	A piece of Corn-stalk cut across at the top and split lengthwise: the cut ends of the woody threads show as scattered dots, and down the side as long fine lines.
78	1232,1770,1669,2123	78. Endogenous Stems.	A block of Palmetto stem cut across and split lengthwise, the cross-section thickly crowded with dots, the ends of many woody threads running down its length.
